/rust/target/

# Core dumps, e.g. from a crash under `go test -race`.
core
core.*

# Locally built native libraries.
#
# These ARE shipped -- they have to be in the tree, because a Go module zip is
# built from the repo at a tag. But only the build-libs workflow should commit
# them, after its smoke jobs have run the Go suite against each one on real
# hardware. Ignoring them here stops a local `make lib` build, which has been
# verified on one platform at most, from being committed by accident. The
# workflow force-adds them; see docs/RELEASING.md.
libs/*/lib/iroh_go.lib
libs/*/lib/iroh_go.lib.sha256
